&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;120groq&quot; data-start=&quot;2934&quot; data-end=&quot;3025&quot;&gt;Experience leading regulatory remediation programmes or responding to regulatory reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1bniima&quot; data-start=&quot;3026&quot; data-end=&quot;3146&quot;&gt;Familiarity with financial crime technology platforms, RegTech solutions, and AI-enabled financial crime capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;12rwn8x&quot; data-start=&quot;3147&quot; data-end=&quot;3267&quot;&gt;Demonstrated leadership in proposition development, thought leadership, or innovation across AML, Sanctions, or Fraud.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1lo9ohs&quot; data-start=&quot;3268&quot; data-end=&quot;3365&quot;&gt;Experience delivering transformation across multiple jurisdictions and regulatory environments.&lt;/li&gt;
