&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;662&quot;&gt;Any information you submit to Datadog as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Datadog’s&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/applicant-candidate-privacy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/applicant-candidate-privacy/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Applicant and Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. For information on our AI policy, please visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/interviewing-at-datadog-ai-guidelines/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Interviewing at Datadog AI Guidelines&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;description content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an Agentic AI Principal to act as a senior technical authority and trusted client advisor for complex agentic AI transformation in Germany, the Netherlands and the wider DACH region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Operating at Principal level, you will shape enterprise AI strategy, define agentic architecture blueprints, lead high-value C-suite engagements and guide complex programmes from opportunity through delivery. You will bring deep hands-on credibility in multi-agent systems, governance and safeguards, while setting reusable patterns and raising capability across teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role has particular focus on sovereign, compliant and production-grade agentic AI for regulated German, Dutch and European enterprises, with a primary focus on healthcare and life sciences (pharma, biotech, medtech and healthcare providers). Experience from other regulated sectors, such as financial services and insurance, automotive and manufacturing, energy and telecommunications, is equally welcome.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our delivery model is moving from large time-and-materials teams to small, AI-first, multidisciplinary pods accountable to a business outcome. You will anchor the agentic side of that work, pairing with our data, tech advisory and industry domain leads from presale through delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a client-facing, builder&#39;s leadership role. You will start with a small, senior team and grow it through technical depth, delivery excellence and thought leadership, rather than inheriting a large organisation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;job-responsibilities&quot;&gt;Job responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-responsibilities content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shaping and winning&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agentic AI advisory and strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; shape and solution complex German, Dutch and DACH pursuits with account, commercial and delivery leaders, translating client needs into differentiated propositions, credible architectures and executable delivery approaches that support regional pipeline conversion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independently drive complex pursuits with technical and executive stakeholders, including shaping the commercial model (fixed-price, outcome-linked), trade-offs and risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a sparring partner to C-suite buyers (CEO, CIO, CDO, CISO, COO): frame business-outcome hypotheses, challenge assumptions and define a thin slice of agentic delivery that proves value quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead AI maturity assessments, identify and prioritise processes for agentisation, and connect architecture choices to measurable business value and ROI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Thoughtworks&#39; agentic AI expertise in strategic client conversations, industry forums, partnerships and thought leadership where appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Designing and building&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design and build engineering:&lt;/strong&gt; set the architecture direction for complex, production-grade agentic AI systems, including multi-agent workflows, orchestration, tool use, memory, context strategy, retrieval, evaluation, observability and enterprise integration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate agents with the German enterprise core: SAP (S/4HANA, BTP), LIMS, QMS and clinical systems, MES/PLM and industrial systems, and legacy back-office platforms, using open protocols such as MCP and A2A where they fit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure agents run on trustworthy data foundations, working with data engineering and data product teams on data quality, semantics and access.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design solutions for regulated German and EU environments, with strong consideration of data sovereignty (EU and German sovereign cloud, open-weight or self-hosted models where required), privacy, security, responsible AI and applicable regulation, including the EU AI Act and GDPR; for healthcare and life sciences GxP, EU MDR/IVDR and the European Health Data Space; and for other sectors DORA, NIS2 and BaFin requirements where relevant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide teams in balancing rapid experimentation with robust production engineering, including evaluation-driven development, testing, CI/CD, reliability, cost and performance optimisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical and delivery leadership for complex programmes, staying hands-on enough to validate architecture, unblock teams, manage technical risk and ensure successful execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with product, data, software engineering, enterprise architecture, governance and change specialists to design end-to-end solutions that deliver measurable business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Governance and safeguards&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish reusable patterns for observability, auditability, traceability and control of agentic systems, enabling teams to demonstrate safe and reliable behaviour in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate EU AI Act obligations (risk classification, human oversight, logging, technical documentation, GPAI-provider responsibilities) into concrete engineering controls and evidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage early with works councils (Betriebsrat, ondernemingsraad), data protection officers and information security, supporting DPIAs and co-determination processes so agentic solutions that touch employee workflows can go live.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Anticipate technical, organisational and governance challenges in enterprise AI adoption and define practical approaches to address them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Principal-level leadership and growing capability&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set reusable architecture patterns, engineering standards and governance practices across multiple teams and engagements, influencing the evolution of Thoughtworks&#39; agentic AI capability beyond an individual programme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set technical direction across multiple teams and initiatives, defining reusable patterns, frameworks and engineering standards for agentic AI delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor senior engineers and technical leads, build the next generation of the German team, and raise AI fluency and agentic engineering standards across specialists and generalists.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate emerging agentic AI technologies and frameworks and guide their responsible adoption based on client context, engineering quality and business value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build our German and Dutch market presence through local-language points of view, ecosystem and partner initiatives (hyperscalers, SAP, European model providers) and community events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;job-qualifications&quot;&gt;Job qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-qualifications content&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;technical-skills&quot;&gt;Technical Skills&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;qualifications inner-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in modern software engineering and Python, with a strong track record of setting standards for testing, CI/CD, observability, maintainability and production reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recognised experience architecting and delivering complex GenAI and agentic AI systems at enterprise scale, from early discovery through production deployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of agentic architectures and frameworks such as LangGraph, AutoGen, CrewAI, LlamaIndex or equivalent, including tool use, orchestration, memory, multi-agent coordination and interoperability protocols (MCP, A2A).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong expertise in Retrieval-Augmented Generation, advanced information retrieval, vector databases and enterprise knowledge integration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing evaluation strategies for GenAI and agentic systems, including quality, safety, reliability, latency and cost measures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of AI governance and safeguards, including guardrails, red-teaming, observability, responsible AI and secure deployment practices (prompt injection, data leakage, tool misuse).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience deploying AI systems on major cloud platforms using containers, orchestration and production-grade infrastructure patterns, including EU sovereign cloud, hybrid or on-premises setups and self-hosted open-weight models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with model adaptation and optimisation techniques, including prompt/context engineering, fine-tuning where appropriate, and application-level performance optimisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to make sound architecture trade-offs across model capability, reliability, security, compliance, performance and cost.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of the EU AI Act, GDPR and sector rules (for healthcare and life sciences: GxP and GAMP 5 computerised-system validation, EU MDR/IVDR, EHDS; for other sectors: DORA, NIS2, BaFin) and how they shape agentic system design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strongly preferred: delivering AI in healthcare or life sciences (e.g. R&amp;amp;D, clinical, regulatory, manufacturing quality, commercial).&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nice to have: integrating agents with SAP and industrial or manufacturing systems; data product and data platform foundations for AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Consulting and Commercial Track Record&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;skills inner-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to lead C-suite and senior client engagements, rapidly establish credibility and advise on both business and technical choices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong consulting and commercial judgement: you can point to data and AI (ideally agentic or GenAI) pursuits you helped shape, sell and deliver in the last three to five years, from around €3M–5M upwards, including fixed-price or outcome-linked elements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience shaping, solutioning, selling and delivering complex deals of €5M+ in the last few years. Annual target of solutioning, selling and delivering €10M+ TCV in Data &amp;amp; AI deals with an AI-first delivery focus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable discussing P&amp;amp;L, business cases and ROI with executive buyers, not just architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consultancy or professional-services experience within the last five years, ideally with German, Dutch or DACH enterprise clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have grown a practice, capability or go-to-market asset (e.g. a reusable accelerator).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Professional Skills&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive presence and communication skills, making complex agentic AI concepts, risks and trade-offs clear to technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven leadership of complex delivery across multidisciplinary teams, moving fluidly between strategy, architecture, governance and hands-on technical leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to influence across organisations without formal authority, align diverse stakeholders and navigate ambiguity in high-value or high-risk programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to mentor senior engineers and technical leaders and raise standards across a wider engineering community.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-directed, prioritisation-led working style, with creative problem-solving in fixed-scope, outcome-driven work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience navigating German and Dutch stakeholder structures, including works councils, data protection officers and procurement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;German B2 minimum&lt;/strong&gt;, C1 strongly preferred; fluent English.&amp;nbsp;Dutch is a plus for Netherlands-based candidates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;important-things&quot;&gt;Other things to know&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;important-things content&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;inner-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There is no one-size-fits-all career path at Thoughtworks: however you want to develop your career is entirely up to you. But we also balance autonomy with the strength of our cultivation culture. This means your career is supported by interactive tools, numerous development programs and teammates who want to help you grow. We see value in helping each other be our best and that extends to empowering our employees in their career journeys.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;responsible-ai-use&quot;&gt;Responsible Use of AI in Recruitment&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;responsible-ai-use content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Thoughtworks, we use AI tools to support our recruitment team with administrative tasks such as drafting communications, scheduling interviews and writing job descriptions.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Crucially, our AI tools do not screen, assess, rank or make hiring decisions. Every application is reviewed by our team and all selection decisions are made exclusively by our interviewers and hiring managers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are committed to fairness and responsible AI. We actively manage our AI systems by testing, monitoring for biased outcomes and implementing mitigation measures. We hold our third-party vendors to these same high standards through a rigorous governance process. For additional information, please see our full &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.thoughtworks.com/careers/ai-policy-for-recruitment&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Thoughtworks AI Policy for Recruitment&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;about&quot;&gt;About Thoughtworks&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;about content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thoughtworks is a dynamic and inclusive community of bright and supportive colleagues who are revolutionizing tech. As a leading technology consultancy, we’re pushing boundaries through our purposeful and impactful work. For 30+ years, we’ve delivered extraordinary impact together with our clients by helping them solve complex business problems with technology as the differentiator. Bring your brilliant expertise and commitment for continuous learning to Thoughtworks. Together, let’s be extraordinary.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;display: none;&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.thoughtworks.com/careers/ai-policy-for-recruitment&quot;&gt;See here our AI policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;GitLab is the intelligent orchestration platform for DevSecOps. GitLab enables organizations to increase developer productivity, improve operational efficiency, reduce security and compliance risk, and accelerate digital transformation. More than 50 million registered users and more than 50% of the Fortune 100* trust GitLab to ship better, more secure software faster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The same principles built into our products are reflected in how our team works: we embrace AI as a core productivity multiplier, with all team members expected to incorporate AI into their daily workflows to drive efficiency, innovation, and impact. GitLab is where careers accelerate, innovation flourishes, and every voice is valued. Our high-performance culture is driven by our values&amp;nbsp;and continuous knowledge exchange, enabling our team members to reach their full potential while collaborating with industry leaders to solve complex problems. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OuZIb5zszQI&quot;&gt;Co-create the future with us&lt;/a&gt; as we build technology that transforms how the world develops software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*&lt;em&gt;Fortune 500® is a registered trademark of Fortune Media IP Limited, used under license. Claim based on GitLab data. Fortune 100 refers to the top 20% ranked companies in the 2025 Fortune 500 list, published in June 2025. Fortune and Fortune Media IP Limited are not affiliated with, and do not endorse products or services of GitLab.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An overview of this role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a SLED Solutions Architect, you&#39;ll be a trusted technical advisor to State, Local, and Education customers in every state east of the Mississippi River: state agencies, counties, cities, special districts, community colleges, and public, private, and research universities. These organizations deliver services residents and students rely on every day, often with lean IT teams, aging systems, fixed fiscal-year budgets, and growing cybersecurity threats.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll show them how GitLab&#39;s DevSecOps platform and AI capabilities, including the GitLab Duo Agent Platform, help them modernize legacy applications, protect sensitive resident and student data, meet state and sector compliance requirements, and do more with the staff they have. You&#39;ll own the technical evaluation and validation stages of the sales cycle, guide customers through proofs of concept and value, and translate platform capabilities into outcomes that agency leaders, CIOs, CISOs, and procurement officers can defend in a budget request or an RFP evaluation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll partner closely with SLED account executives, channel partners, and systems integrators, provide technical guidance from first conversation through successful deployment, and bring the voice of the SLED customer back into Product, Sales, and Marketing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location and travel:&lt;/strong&gt; The territory covers all states east of the Mississippi River. The candidate must reside in the Northeast part of the United States. This role requires up to 50% travel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage SLED customers onsite and remotely, from state capitals to university campuses, with tailored demos, technical presentations, and hands-on workshops that tie GitLab to their mission.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with SLED account executives to shape account strategies that align with each customer&#39;s fiscal year budget cycle, legislative appropriations, IT modernization plans, and grant or federal pass through funding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the technical evaluation process, including proof of concept (POC) and proof of value (POV) design and delivery, and provide technical responses for RFIs, RFPs, RFQs, and security questionnaires.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support purchases made through cooperative purchasing agreements and statewide contract vehicles by working with channel and reseller partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide customers through state and sector security requirements, such as GovRAMP and NIST frameworks, and show how GitLab&#39;s built in security, auditability, and deployment options reduce compliance burden.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help agencies and institutions modernize legacy and mainframe applications, such as unemployment insurance, tax, DMV, benefits, and student information systems, using GitLab and AI-assisted development to lower risk and offset shrinking pools of legacy skilled staff.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise customers on adopting AI responsibly, including the GitLab Duo Agent Platform, in line with state AI policies, governance boards, and data privacy requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the creation of Customer Success Plans that capture technical success criteria and handoff details, ensuring a smooth path to deployment and adoption, often for IT teams with limited capacity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work alongside Account Executives to build data driven business cases that quantify delivery bottlenecks, giving customers a defensible basis for budget requests and clear evidence of return on taxpayer investment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build relationships with CIOs, CISOs, agency directors, enterprise architects, faculty, research computing leaders, and procurement officers so they become advocates for GitLab, including across agencies and campuses that share services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with systems integrators and state IT shared-services organizations to scale GitLab adoption across multiple agencies, local governments, or campuses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the SLED customer advocate internally, channeling feedback on procurement, compliance, and deployment needs to Product, Sales, and Marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current on GitLab and related technologies, and create reusable SLED demos, reference architectures, and assets for customers and partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in technical pre-sales, consulting, or IT roles serving state agencies, local governments, or public, private, and research universities, where you guided customers through evaluations and solution design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of how SLED organizations buy technology: RFP and RFI cycles, cooperative purchasing agreements, statewide contracts, fiscal-year budgeting, and the role of resellers and systems integrators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience using GitLab and familiarity with modern software development and operations practices, such as CI/CD, DevSecOps, and automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with cloud, hybrid, and self-managed deployments in regulated environments, including government cloud regions, and an understanding of data residency and sovereignty concerns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with security and compliance frameworks common in SLED, such as GovRAMP and NIST SP 800-53.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to connect technical solutions to mission outcomes, such as resident service delivery, cyber resilience, cost avoidance, and workforce efficiency, and to advise senior stakeholders on tradeoffs and options.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and relationship-building skills, including presenting to both technical teams and non-technical leaders such as agency heads, procurement officers, and university administrators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Openness to learning, seeking feedback, and building new skills, including familiarity with GitLab&#39;s Solutions Architect handbook and related resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience working in or for state or local government IT, or a university IT or research computing organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with legacy or mainframe modernization programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with AI governance practices in the public sector, such as AI use-case inventories, acceptable-use policies, and risk assessments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The SLED Solutions Architect role is part of GitLab&#39;s Public Sector Solutions Architect team, a group of trusted technical advisors who help government and education customers understand, evaluate, and adopt the GitLab DevSecOps platform. The team is distributed and collaborates asynchronously across time zones using GitLab and our handbook-first practices to share knowledge, reusable examples, and best practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;On the SLED team, you&#39;ll help customers solve challenges unique to state, local, and education organizations: protecting resident and student data, modernizing mission-critical legacy systems, buying through public procurement processes, and stretching limited IT staff and budgets. You&#39;ll also bring SLED customer insights back to GitLab to shape product direction.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How GitLab Supports Full-Time Employees&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/&quot;&gt;Benefits to support your health, finances, and well-being&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/time-off-and-absence/time-off-types/#flexible-paid-time-off-pto&quot;&gt;Flexible Paid Time Off&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/company/culture/inclusion/tmrg-tmag/&quot;&gt;Team Member Resource Groups&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/stock-options/&quot;&gt;Equity Compensation &amp;amp; Employee Stock Purchase Plan&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/learning-and-development/growth-and-development/&quot;&gt;Growth and Development Fund&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/#parental-leave&quot;&gt;Parental Leave&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note that we welcome interest from candidates with varying levels of experience; many successful candidates do not meet every single requirement. Additionally, studies have shown that people from &lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/company/culture/inclusion/#examples-of-select-underrepresented-groups&quot;&gt;underrepresented groups&lt;/a&gt; are less likely to apply to a job unless they meet every single qualification. If you&#39;re excited about this role, please apply and allow our recruiters to assess your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Country Hiring Guidelines: &lt;/strong&gt;GitLab hires new team members in countries around the world. All of our roles are remote, however some roles may carry specific location-based eligibility requirements. Our Talent Acquisition team can help answer any questions about location after starting the recruiting process.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy: &lt;/strong&gt;Please review our &lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/candidate-faq/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt; Your privacy is important to us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GitLab is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace and is an affirmative action employer. GitLab’s policies and practices relating to recruitment, employment, career development and advancement, promotion, and retirement are based solely on merit, regardless of race, color, religion, ancestry, sex (including pregnancy, lactation, sexual orientation, gender identity, or gender expression), national origin, age, citizenship, marital status, mental or physical disability, genetic information (including family medical history), discharge status from the military, protected veteran status (which includes disabled veterans, recently separated veterans, active duty wartime or campaign badge veterans, and Armed Forces service medal veterans), or any other basis protected by law. GitLab will not tolerate discrimination or harassment based on any of these characteristics. See also&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#equal-employment-opportunity-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;GitLab’s EEO Policy&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/labor-and-employment-notices/#eeoc-us-equal-employment-opportunity-commission-notices&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO is the Law&lt;/a&gt;. If you have a disability or special need that requires&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#reasonable-accommodation&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;accommodation&lt;/a&gt;, please let us know during the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/interviewing/#adjustments-to-our-interview-process&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;recruiting process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our leading SaaS-based Global Employment Platform™ enables clients to expand into over 180 countries quickly and efficiently, without the complexities of establishing local entities. At G-P, we’re dedicated to breaking down barriers to global business and creating opportunities for everyone, everywhere.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our diverse, remote-first teams are essential to our success. We empower our Dream Team members with flexibility and resources, fostering an environment where innovation thrives and every contribution is valued and celebrated.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;The work you do here will positively impact lives around the world. We stand by our promise: Opportunity Made Possible. In addition to competitive compensation and benefits, we invite you to join us in expanding your skills and helping to reshape the future of work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;At G-P, we assist organizations in building exceptional global teams in days, not months—streamlining the hiring, onboarding, and management process to unlock growth potential for all.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Field Account Executive&lt;/strong&gt;, you will join a high-performing team laser-focused on taking over the market, building a world-class company, and solving the complex international expansion needs of thousands of employers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this full-cycle outbound role, you will lead the charge in driving new logo acquisition across the EMEA region. We are looking for relentless hunters who excel at multi-threaded deal execution, master modern prospecting frameworks, and leverage cutting-edge AI tools to maximize their impact. If you thrive in a fast-paced environment and have a deep desire to win, this is your opportunity to build a high-growth sales career at the recognized leader in Employer of Record (EoR).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Targeted Outbound Prospecting:&lt;/strong&gt; Execute a sophisticated multi-channel prospecting motion (phone, email, social selling, video, etc.) to build a robust, high-quality pipeline across target EMEA accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Multi-Threaded Engagement:&lt;/strong&gt; Build strategic relationships across prospect organizations—from key operational champions up to economic buyers and C-level executives—aligning our solutions with their top-level business initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver the G-P Value Proposition:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a domain expert on global hiring, articulating the strategic, financial, and operational benefits of G-P as the premier global Employer of Record (EoR) provider.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full-Cycle Deal Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead complex sales cycles from initial cold outreach to discovery, solution mapping, commercial proposal generation, objection handling, and deal closure against monthly targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rigorously Manage Pipeline:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain meticulous pipeline hygiene across all prospect stages, ensuring accurate forecasting and high-quality data management within Salesforce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Coordination:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with internal teams—including Sales Engineering, Legal, Marketing, Operations and Customer Success—to align resources, navigate complex deal requirements, and drive revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leverage AI for Maximum Impact:&lt;/strong&gt; Intentionally integrate modern generative AI and sales tech tools into your daily workflow to research accounts, personalize outreach, automate workflows, and increase sales velocity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Minimum Requirements&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; Bachelor’s degree in Business, Finance, International Relations, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 5+ years of sales experience, with 3+ years of proven success in a full-cycle, outbound-focused B2B sales role with a track record of consistently meeting or exceeding revenue quotas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Outbound Mastery:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated ownership of an end-to-end multi-channel prospecting motion, with advanced skills in cold outreach and C-suite engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Methodologies:&lt;/strong&gt; High competency and structured application of modern sales methodologies (e.g., Command of the Message, MEDDPICC, Challenger, Sandler, SPIN).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tech Stack &amp;amp; AI Proficiency:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong proficiency with Salesforce and LinkedIn Sales Navigator. Hands-on experience leveraging modern Generative AI tools to enhance prospecting efficiency and workflow productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep understanding of B2B SaaS sales cycles, commercial negotiation, and complex buyer dynamics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High-Impact Communicator:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional written, verbal, and presentation skills, with the ability to command attention, articulate complex value, and build immediate trust over video and phone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Mindset &amp;amp; Drive:&lt;/strong&gt; A strong desire to win, high coachability, a relentless growth mindset, and an authentic curiosity for solving complex customer problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Prior experience selling within the HR Tech, Employer of Record (EoR), global payroll, or workforce management ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Intelligence Tools:&lt;/strong&gt; Familiarity with modern revenue intelligence and tech stack tools (e.g., Gong, Clari, Cognism, Outreach).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;message-list_1761669766.039629&quot; class=&quot;c-virtual_list__item&quot; data-qa=&quot;virtual-list-item&quot; data-item-key=&quot;1761669766.039629&quot;&gt;
