&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);&quot;&gt;Non-Sales Roles: This position is eligible for an annual bonus which is paid dependent on various factors, including and without limitation, individual and company performance in addition to base salary.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
